    "text": "<p>The figure&nbsp;shows a circuit that contains four identical resistors with resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;two identical inductors with inductance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math> and an ideal battery with E.M.F.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math> just after the switch <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is closed will be:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0121_600821dbadf3.png\" style=\"width: 287px; height: 144px;\" /></p>"
  },
