  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Just after the switch is closed, inductor will behave like infinite resistance (open circuit) so the circuit will look like</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0121_5c2b09e6ee9e.png\" style=\"width: 221px; height: 168px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>"
